# Finance & import rules

- The `Transaction` ledger is the only financial source of truth. Imports converge via `ImportCandidate` → confirm → `createLedgerTransaction(source=IMPORT)`.
- Never auto-post imported transactions. Suggest → confirm remains the default.
- Never store raw email bodies or OAuth tokens in API responses, logs, Activity, Notifications, or analytics.
- OAuth tokens at rest require AES-256-GCM (`EMAIL_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY`). Gmail OAuth `state` must be signed and validated (CSRF).
- Deterministic parsers only unless a future ADR explicitly allows AI candidates — AI output remains untrusted and must pass the same validation + confirm path.
- Do not log amounts, merchants, email bodies, or tokens. Sync logs are operational counts only.
